    "              <div class='place-actions'>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/resorts%20near%20Diniwid%20Beach%20Boracay%2C%20Aklan' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Find resorts near Diniwid Beach'>Nearby resorts</a>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Diniwid%20Beach%20Boracay%2C%20Aklan' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Get directions to Diniwid Beach'>Get directions</a>",
    "              </div>",
    "            </div>",
    "          </article>",
    "",
    "          <!-- 10. Bon Bon Beach -->",
    "          <article class='place-card searchable' data-search='Bon Bon Beach Romblon, Romblon Beaches Visayas'>",
    "            <img src='images/destinations/visayas-beach-10.jpg' alt='Sunset at Bon Bon Beach in Romblon.' loading='lazy' onerror=\"this.outerHTML='<div class=&quot;image-fallback&quot;>Bon Bon Beach photo</div>'\">",
    "            <div class='place-body'>",
    "              <h4>10. Bon Bon Beach</h4>",
    "              <p><strong>Location:</strong> Romblon, Romblon</p>",
    "              <p><strong>Google Rating:</strong> 4.3/5 — <em>By The Coastal Campaign</em></p>",
    "<p><strong>Photo:</strong> <a href='https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bon_Bon_Serene_Sunset.jpg' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Franktapia1 (CC BY-SA 4.0)</a></p>",
    "              <p>Bon Bon Beach is known for its white sand and scenic sandbar.</p>",
    "              <h5>Natural attractions</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>White sand</li>",
    "                <li>Coastal waters</li>",
    "                <li>A sandbar extending toward a nearby islet</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Things to do</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Beach walking</li>",
    "                <li>Sightseeing</li>",
    "                <li>Photography</li>",
    "                <li>Swimming where safe</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Travel preparations</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Bring drinking water, sunscreen, extra clothes, and cash.</li>",
    "                <li>Visit when the tide allows safe access and confirm local transportation arrangements.</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Safety guideline</h5>",
    "              <p>Check tide schedules and sea conditions before approaching the sandbar.</p>",
    "              <div class='place-actions'>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/resorts%20near%20Bon%20Bon%20Beach%20Romblon%2C%20Romblon' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Find resorts near Bon Bon Beach'>Nearby resorts</a>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Bon%20Bon%20Beach%20Romblon%2C%20Romblon' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Get directions to Bon Bon Beach'>Get directions</a>",
