    "",
    "    <section class=\"region-section\">",
    "      <div class=\"container\">",
    "        <h1 class=\"section-title\">Mindanao Beaches</h1>",
    "        <h2>Mindanao</h2>",
    "        <p class=\"section-description\">Mindanao offers island beaches, river landscapes, and major mountain ecosystems. Selected destinations span Camiguin, Surigao del Sur, Surigao del Norte, Davao Oriental, Basilan, Sarangani, Zamboanga City, and Davao del Norte.</p>",
    "        <img class='region-cover' src='images/cover-mindanao.jpg' alt='A landscape view of Camiguin Island in Northern Mindanao.' loading='lazy' onerror=\"this.outerHTML='<div class=&quot;cover-fallback&quot;>Mindanao cover photo</div>'\">",
    "        <h3 class='category-title' id='mindanao-beaches'>Beaches</h3>",
    "        <div class='card-grid'>",
    "          <!-- 1. White Island -->",
    "          <article class='place-card searchable' data-search='White Island Mambajao, Camiguin Beaches Mindanao'>",
    "            <img src='images/destinations/mindanao-beach-1.jpg' alt='White Island sandbar off the coast of Camiguin.' loading='lazy' onerror=\"this.outerHTML='<div class=&quot;image-fallback&quot;>White Island photo</div>'\">",
    "            <div class='place-body'>",
    "              <h4>1. White Island</h4>",
    "              <p><strong>Location:</strong> Mambajao, Camiguin</p>",
    "              <p><strong>Google Rating:</strong> 4.7/5 — <em>By Project Lupad</em></p>",
    "<p><strong>Photo:</strong> <a href='https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_White_Island_of_Camiguin.jpg' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Wilborne Ian Lustre (CC BY-SA 4.0)</a></p>",
    "              <p>White Island is an uninhabited sandbar known for its clear waters and panoramic views of Camiguin's volcanic landscape.</p>",
    "              <h5>Natural attractions</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>White sandbar</li>",
    "                <li>Clear surrounding waters</li>",
    "                <li>Views of Mount Hibok-Hibok</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Things to do</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Swimming where safe</li>",
    "                <li>Snorkeling in suitable areas</li>",
    "                <li>Sightseeing</li>",
    "                <li>Photography</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Travel preparations</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Bring drinking water, sunscreen, a hat, and waterproof bags.</li>",
    "                <li>Arrange a boat trip in advance and bring sun protection because shade is limited.</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Safety guideline</h5>",
    "              <p>Follow boat operators' instructions and check weather and sea conditions.</p>",
    "              <div class='place-actions'>",
