  "directions.html": [
    "<section class=\"section\" id=\"directions\" style=\"background:var(--paper)\"><div class=\"container\"><h1 class=\"section-title\">Directions</h1><p class=\"section-description\">This guide helps you plan how to reach each destination. Routes are general and should be checked before travel.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Destination</th><th>Nearest city/airport</th><th>Common way to get there</th><th>Map link</th></tr></thead><tbody>\r",
    "<tr><td>Saud Beach</td><td>Laoag</td><td>Fly to Laoag, then travel by land to Pagudpud.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Saud+Beach+Pagudpud+Ilocos+Norte\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Anawangin Cove</td><td>Olongapo / San Antonio</td><td>Travel by land to San Antonio, then arrange local boat access.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Anawangin+Cove+Zambales\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Pagsanjan River</td><td>Manila / Santa Cruz</td><td>Travel by land to Pagsanjan, Laguna.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Pagsanjan+River+Laguna\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Chico River</td><td>Tabuk</td><td>Travel by land to the selected river area in Kalinga.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chico+River+Kalinga\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Mt. Pulag</td><td>Baguio</td><td>Travel by land to an authorized trailhead and register locally.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mount+Pulag\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Mt. Pinatubo crater lake</td><td>Manila / Capas</td><td>Travel to an authorized jump-off point and join an approved guided trip.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mount+Pinatubo+Crater+Lake\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Boracay White Beach</td><td>Caticlan</td><td>Fly to Caticlan, then use authorized transfer services to Boracay.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Boracay+White+Beach\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Malapascua Island</td><td>Cebu City</td><td>Travel by land to Maya port, then take a local boat to the island.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Malapascua+Island+Cebu\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Loboc River</td><td>Tagbilaran</td><td>Travel by land from Tagbilaran to Loboc.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Loboc+River+Bohol\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Abatan River</td><td>Tagbilaran</td><td>Travel by land to a local Abatan River access point.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Abatan+River+Bohol\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Osmeña Peak</td><td>Cebu City</td><td>Travel by land to Dalaguete and arrange local trail access.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Osmena+Peak+Cebu\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Mt. Kanlaon</td><td>Bacolod / Dumaguete</td><td>Travel by land to a permitted area; check restrictions before approaching.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mount+Kanlaon+Negros\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Cloud 9, Siargao</td><td>Sayak Airport</td><td>Fly to Siargao, then travel by land to General Luna.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Cloud+9+General+Luna+Siargao\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Samal Island</td><td>Davao City</td><td>Travel to a Davao port and take an authorized ferry or boat.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Samal+Island+Davao+del+Norte\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Cagayan de Oro River</td><td>Laguindingan Airport</td><td>Travel to Cagayan de Oro, then arrange rafting with a local operator.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Cagayan+de+Oro+River\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Agusan River</td><td>Butuan</td><td>Travel by land to a local river access point in the Agusan area.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Agusan+River+Philippines\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Mt. Apo</td><td>Davao City</td><td>Travel to an authorized trailhead and follow local permit arrangements.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mount+Apo\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "<tr><td>Mt. Hamiguitan</td><td>Davao City</td><td>Travel by land to the sanctuary area with authorized local arrangements.</td><td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mount+Hamiguitan+Davao+Oriental\">Map</a></td></tr>\r",
    "</tbody></table></div><div class=\"plain-card\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><h3>Travel planning tip</h3><p>Use Google Maps or Waze for live routes, ask the local tourism office or your accommodation about current road and sea conditions, and book transport through licensed operators. Transportation schedules and conditions can change.</p></div></div></section>"
  ].join("\n"),
