    "              <p>Agus River is an important river in Mindanao that flows from Lake Lanao toward Iligan Bay. It is known for its powerful flowing waters and its role in generating hydroelectric power. The river is also home to beautiful natural scenery, including waterfalls and green surroundings.</p>",
