    "              <p>Tagoloan River is a major river system in Northern Mindanao. It begins in the highlands of Bukidnon, near the slopes of Mount Kitanglad, and flows through Misamis Oriental before reaching Macajalar Bay. The river is important to nearby communities, especially for agriculture and water resources.</p>",
