    "          <article class='place-card searchable' data-search='Mount Pulag Kabayan, Benguet Mountains Luzon'>",
    "            <img src='images/destinations/luzon-mountain-1.jpg' alt='A fog bow appears during a morning climb in Mount Pulag National Park.' loading='lazy' onerror=\"this.outerHTML='<div class=&quot;image-fallback&quot;>Mount Pulag photo</div>'\">",
    "            <div class='place-body'>",
    "              <h4>1. Mount Pulag</h4>",
    "              <p><strong>Location:</strong> Kabayan, Benguet</p>",
    "              <p><strong>Google Rating:</strong> 4.7 (658) — <em>By Wikipedia</em></p>",
    "              <p>Mount Pulag is the highest peak in Luzon and the third highest mountain in the Philippines, standing at an elevation of 2,928 meters.</p>",
    "              <h5>Natural attractions</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Sea of clouds</li>",
    "                <li>Dwarf bamboo grassland</li>",
    "                <li>Mossy forest</li>",
    "                <li>Diverse endemic wildlife</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Things to do</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Summit trekking and hiking</li>",
    "                <li>Photography</li>",
    "                <li>Camping under the stars</li>",
    "                <li>Sightseeing stops and stargazing</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Nearby tourist spots</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Scenic dams</li>",
    "                <li>High-altitude flower farms</li>",
    "                <li>Cherry blossom parks</li>",
    "                <li>Mountain lookouts</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Travel preparations</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Permits, requirements, and booking</li>",
    "                <li>Cold-weather clothing gear</li>",
    "                <li>Hiking essentials and equipment</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Safety guideline</h5>",
    "              <p>Mount Pulag safety guidelines require mandatory medical clearance, pre-registration through the Department of Environmental and Natural Resources (DENR), certified local guides, and proper cold-weather gear to handle near-freezing temperatures and high-altitude conditions.</p>",
    "              <div class='place-actions'>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/resorts%20near%20Mount%20Pulag%20Kabayan%2C%20Benguet' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Find resorts near Mount Pulag'>Nearby resorts</a>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mount%20Pulag%20Kabayan%2C%20Benguet' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Get directions to Mount Pulag'>Get directions</a>",
    "              </div>",
    "            </div>",
    "          </article>",
    "",
    "          <!-- 2. Mount Ulap -->",
    "          <article class='place-card searchable' data-search='Mount Ulap Itogon, Benguet Mountains Luzon'>",
    "            <img src='images/destinations/luzon-mountain-2.jpg' alt='Ridges of Mount Ulap in Itogon, Benguet.' loading='lazy' onerror=\"this.outerHTML='<div class=&quot;image-fallback&quot;>Mount Ulap photo</div>'\">",
    "            <div class='place-body'>",
    "              <h4>2. Mount Ulap</h4>",
    "              <p><strong>Location:</strong> Barangay Ampucao, Itogon, Benguet, Philippines</p>",
