    "              <p>Mount Ulap is a scenic, beginner-friendly mountain and eco-trail in Itogon, Benguet. It is famous for its pine forests, grassland ridges, and sea-of-clouds views. Its name comes from the Filipino word \"ulap\" (cloud).</p>",
    "              <h5>Natural attractions</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Alpine pine forests</li>",
    "                <li>Rolling grassland ridges</li>",
    "                <li>Scenic high-altitude views</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Things to do</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Day hiking and overnight camping</li>",
    "                <li>Sea-of-clouds and sunrise viewing</li>",
    "                <li>Photography</li>",
    "                <li>Mountain biking and nature exploration</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Nearby tourist spots</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Scenic nature parks</li>",
    "                <li>Waterfalls</li>",
    "                <li>Cultural sites near Mount Ulap and other areas of Benguet</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Travel preparations</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Secure permits and book a local guide.</li>",
    "                <li>Bring proper hiking gear for cold and unpredictable weather.</li>",
    "                <li>Plan your transportation.</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Safety guideline</h5>",
    "              <p>Follow local registration and guide requirements, check trail and weather conditions, bring enough water and food, and follow environmental rules.</p>",
    "              <div class='place-actions'>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/resorts%20near%20Mount%20Ulap%20Itogon%2C%20Benguet' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Find resorts near Mount Ulap'>Nearby resorts</a>",
