    "          <!-- 5. Mount Pico de Loro -->",
    "          <article class='place-card searchable' data-search='Mount Pico de Loro Maragondon, Cavite and Nasugbu, Batangas, Luzon Mountains Luzon'>",
    "            <img src='images/destinations/luzon-mountain-5.jpg' alt='Mount Pico de Loro in the Palay-Palay range.' loading='lazy' onerror=\"this.outerHTML='<div class=&quot;image-fallback&quot;>Mount Pico de Loro photo</div>'\">",
    "            <div class='place-body'>",
    "              <h4>5. Mount Pico de Loro</h4>",
    "              <p><strong>Location:</strong> Border of Maragondon, Cavite and Nasugbu, Batangas, Luzon, Philippines</p>",
    "              <p><strong>Google Rating:</strong> 4.6 (113 reviews) — <em>By Pinoy Mountaineer</em></p>",
    "<p><strong>Photo:</strong> <a href='https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mount_Pico_de_Loro,_Nasugbu,_Philippines.jpg' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Fabian Irsara (CC0)</a></p>",
    "              <p>Mount Pico de Loro, also known as Mount Palay-Palay, is a dormant stratovolcano and the highest peak in Cavite. It is located inside the Mounts Palay-Palay–Mataas-na-Gulod Protected Landscape.</p>",
    "              <h5>Natural attractions</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>The Monolith</li>",
    "                <li>Lowland rainforest ecosystem</li>",
    "                <li>Rich flora and fauna</li>",
    "                <li>Pico de Loro Waterfalls</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Things to do</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Hiking and trekking</li>",
    "                <li>Birdwatching and nature trails</li>",
    "                <li>Swimming, beach lounging, and water sports</li>",
    "                <li>Diving and snorkeling</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Nearby tourist spots</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>The Monolith, also known as the Parrot's Beak, a 60-meter natural rock formation at the summit</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Travel preparations</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Book your hike in advance and prepare for entrance fees and other expenses.</li>",
    "                <li>Bring proper clothing and hiking gear for tropical forests and steep trails.</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Safety guideline</h5>",
    "              <p>Follow current advisories and trail safety rules. Respect DENR and PAMB regulations, and observe environmental guidelines to protect the area. Follow booking and entrance requirements, and consider using public transportation when traveling to Mount Pico de Loro.</p>",
    "              <div class='place-actions'>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/resorts%20near%20Mount%20Pico%20de%20Loro%20Maragondon%2C%20Cavite' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Find resorts near Mount Pico de Loro'>Nearby resorts</a>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mount%20Pico%20de%20Loro%20Maragondon%2C%20Cavite' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Get directions to Mount Pico de Loro'>Get directions</a>",
    "              </div>",
    "            </div>",
