    "          <!-- 7. Mount Makiling -->",
    "          <article class='place-card searchable' data-search='Mount Makiling Los Banos, Laguna, Philippines Mountains Luzon'>",
    "            <img src='images/destinations/luzon-mountain-7.jpg' alt='Mount Makiling near Los Baños, Laguna.' loading='lazy' onerror=\"this.outerHTML='<div class=&quot;image-fallback&quot;>Mount Makiling photo</div>'\">",
    "            <div class='place-body'>",
    "              <h4>7. Mount Makiling</h4>",
    "              <p><strong>Location:</strong> Los Baños, Laguna, Philippines</p>",
    "              <p><strong>Google Rating:</strong> 4.5 (201 reviews) — <em>By Steemit</em></p>",
    "              <p>Mount Makiling is an inactive stratovolcano located between Laguna and Batangas, standing at 1,090 meters above sea level. It is famous for its reclining woman-shaped profile, believed to be the mythical guardian spirit Mariang Makiling. It is also an ASEAN Heritage Park known for its rich biodiversity and tropical rainforests.</p>",
    "              <h5>Natural attractions</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Mud springs</li>",
    "                <li>Flat rocks</li>",
    "                <li>Diverse flora and fauna</li>",
    "                <li>Peak 2</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Things to do</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Eco-hiking and trekking</li>",
    "                <li>Birdwatching</li>",
    "                <li>Mountain biking</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Nearby tourist spots</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Makiling Botanic Garden</li>",
    "                <li>Splash Mountain and hot spring resorts</li>",
    "                <li>UPLB Campus and Museum of Natural History</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Travel preparations</h5>",
    "              <ul>",
    "                <li>Secure an online booking and register at the UPLB College of Forestry and Natural Resources outpost.</li>",
    "                <li>Bring a valid government ID, hire a local guide, and prepare for a 4-to-7-hour trek.</li>",
    "              </ul>",
    "              <h5>Safety guideline</h5>",
    "              <p>Watch out for limatik, follow the 9:00 AM cutoff at Agila Base, and stay on designated trails to avoid landslides and dangerous drop-offs. Wear long sleeves and high socks or use insect repellent, bring at least two liters of water, trail snacks, and plastic bags for your trash, and hike during dry weather to avoid slippery trails.</p>",
    "              <div class='place-actions'>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/resorts%20near%20Mount%20Makiling%20Los%20Banos%2C%20Laguna' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Find resorts near Mount Makiling'>Nearby resorts</a>",
    "                <a class='button' href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Mount%20Makiling%20Los%20Banos%2C%20Laguna' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' aria-label='Get directions to Mount Makiling'>Get directions</a>",
    "              </div>",
    "            </div>",
    "          </article>",
